{
  "run_id": "PMC12693294__broad__web_text_chunks__s2",
  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Al–Co–Cr–Fe–Ni high-entropy alloys, phase stability is governed by competition between configurational mixing entropy and the enthalpy of forming secondary or ordered phases.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4976365::web::001::body"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increasing temperature favors entropy-stabilized solid solutions, whereas favorable ordering enthalpy can overcome entropy at lower temperatures.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4976365::web::001::body"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Composition changes can alter the formation of secondary phases in Al-containing high-entropy alloys.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11396108::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC9570936::web::001::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thermal processing can control the entropy–enthalpy competition and resulting phase stability in Al–Co–Cr–Fe–Ni.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4976365::web::001::body",
        "PMC9570936::web::001::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is to vary composition, add unspecified alloying elements, or apply different unspecified thermal treatments.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant structural mediator is the formation of secondary phases such as precipitates.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11396108::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC9570936::web::001::1_introduction",
        "PMC6105605::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grain boundaries are secondary phases whose formation mediates the proposed response.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Changes in secondary-phase formation lead to changes in mechanical properties.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11396108::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC6105605::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will improve high-temperature strength relative to the as-cast or solution-treated baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11396108::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will improve environmental resistance relative to the baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will improve radiation tolerance relative to the baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will improve cryogenic toughness relative to the baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4740901::web::001::body",
        "PMC5494191::web::001::body",
        "PMC5793551::web::001::1_introduction",
        "PMC7012927::web::001::introduction",
        "PMC12112771::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A single composition-and-processing adjustment can balance high-temperature strength, environmental resistance, radiation tolerance, and cryogenic toughness.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hypothesis is bounded by solubility limits.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hypothesis is bounded by the thermal stability of the resulting phases.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11396108::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC4976365::web::001::body"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Systematic composition and processing variation followed by diffraction, microscopy, tensile testing, and fracture-toughness testing can evaluate phase stability and mechanical properties.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Failure to observe all four predicted property improvements would falsify the proposed entropy–enthalpy mechanism.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.falsification_rule",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    }
